@startuml circuit-breaker
title Circuit breaker on webhook delivery (Resilience4j)
hide empty description

[*] --> Closed
Closed : POST to notificationUrl goes through,
Closed : the last 10 calls are counted
Open : no call, the row waits;
Open : attempts are not spent
HalfOpen : one trial call

Closed --> Open : half of the last 10 calls failed, at least 5 calls\n(timeout, 5xx, no connection)
Open --> HalfOpen : the first call after 30 s
HalfOpen --> Closed : the trial call succeeded
HalfOpen --> Open : the trial call failed

legend bottom
  One instance per merchant (its notificationUrl). 4xx is a failed attempt but not a breaker failure.
  Rows stay in webhooks with delivered = false; nothing is lost while open.
  Metrics resilience4j_circuitbreaker_* → Grafana; an alert when open for 1 min.
end legend
@enduml
